From 295617a269afe483843676790d8f253b9e9c7b78 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sam Ottenhoff <ottenhoff@longsight.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 08:10:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Parse JSP translation units with an ordered document root

Represent JSP pages and include fragments as Xml.JspDocument, preserving ordered top-level syntax without a synthetic wrapper. Add an explicit JspParser, visitor/printer and RPC support, document-aware XPath and formatting, and complete-input checks that reject silently unparsed markup.

Validated all 346 XML module tests using the 8.93.8 XML sources with public 8.90.4 core dependencies. On an unchanged 245-JSP Samigo corpus, complete byte-identical parses increase from 14 to 82; all previous successes remain successful. Current Gradle dependency resolution is not part of this validation.
